   "source": [
    "# 1.content的使用\n",
    "消息的 content 可以理解为数据内容，它是弱类型的，支持字符串和列表（列表元素通常为字典）。\n",
    "\n",
    "举例1：存储字符串\n",
    "\n",
    "如果只是纯文本内容，直接传递字符串就好。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from LangChain.messages import HumanMessage\n",
    "msg1 = HumanMessage(content = \"你好啊\")\n",
    "msg2 = HumanMessage(\"你好啊\")\n",
    "print(msg1)\n",
    "print(msg2)"
   ]
  }
